{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56860","headline":"选人爲崔沔王丘歌（题拟） · 佚名","name":"选人爲崔沔王丘歌（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沔人澄明澈底清，丘山介直连天峻。\n（见三长物斋刊本《颜鲁公文集》卷五《通议大夫守太子宾客东都副留守云骑尉赠尚书左仆射博陵崔孝公宅陋室铭记》引）（记云：「明我〖开元十四年〗，入朝，分掌十铨，公与王丘爲选人所歌曰〖略〗。\n时人韪之。\n」按：《全唐诗》卷八七六女作时人语，二句互乙，文字有数处不同，故重录之。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56860.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56860","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}